ssue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.7.2.stable.official [ed1daf0bf]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.2.stable - macOS Tahoe (26.6.0) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M1 Pro (Apple7) - Apple M1 Pro (8 threads) - 32.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nFor example, if you enter a word starting with “h” in the label text while in Japanese input mode, the node will toggle between visible and hidden.\nIt seems as though a keyboard shortcut has been triggered.\n\n<img width=\"256\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4d7f55cd-e2f7-4c39-b0e8-862a84a4b969\" />\n\n<img width=\"256\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3599ef66-2bc0-428d-8f8d-4da0526529a7\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nThis issue occurs on macOS. It does not occur on Windows. \n \n3. Open MRP, and open node_2d.tscn.\n4. Select Label in the scene.\n5. Focus Label's Text property.\n6. Enter “h” in Japanese.\n7. Label visibility has been changed.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp_short_cut_key.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/31401718/mrp_short_cut_key.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/user